  "ui_html": "<div aria-modal=\"true\" class=\"modal fade show\" id=\"kt_modal_email_preview\" role=\"dialog\" style=\"display: block;\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-xl\">\n<div class=\"modal-content\">\n<div class=\"modal-header\">\n<div class=\"d-flex flex-column\">\n<h2 class=\"fw-bold mb-1\" id=\"emailPreviewCampaignName\">Campaign - Maturity Assessment\\u002D Phase 2</h2>\n<div class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-3\">\n<span class=\"text-muted fs-7\">\n<i class=\"ki-duotone ki-abstract-26 fs-7 me-1\"><span class=\"path1\"></span><span class=\"path2\"></span></i>\n                                Subject: <span class=\"fw-semibold text-gray-700\" id=\"emailPreviewSubject\">Is your supply chain ready for 2026?</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"text-muted fs-7\">\u00b7</span>\n<span class=\"text-muted fs-7\">\n<i class=\"ki-duotone ki-calendar fs-7 me-1\"><span class=\"path1\"></span><span class=\"path2\"></span></i>\n                                Sent: <span class=\"fw-semibold text-gray-700\" id=\"emailPreviewSentAt\">Apr 24, 2026 at 15:22</span>\n</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"btn btn-icon btn-sm btn-active-icon-primary ms-auto\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\">\n<i class=\"ki-duotone ki-cross fs-1\"><span class=\"path1\"></span><span class=\"path2\"></span></i>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"modal-body p-0\">\n<!-- Toolbar -->\n<div class=\"d-flex align-items-center px-7 py-3 border-bottom border-gray-200 bg-light\">\n<div class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-2\">\n<span class=\"badge badge-light-primary fs-8 px-3 py-2\">\n<i class=\"ki-duotone ki-sms fs-7 me-1\"><span class=\"path1\"></span><span class=\"path2\"></span></i>\n                                To: sidharth@likwid.co.in\n                            </span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ms-auto d-flex gap-2\">\n<button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-light-primary\" id=\"emailPreviewToggle\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"ki-duotone ki-code fs-5\"><span class=\"path1\"></span><span class=\"path2\"></span><span class=\"path3\"></span><span class=\"path4\"></span></i> View Source</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Rendered HTML view -->\n<div id=\"emailPreviewRendered\" style=\"min-height:400px; max-height:600px; overflow-y:auto;\">\n<!-- \u2705 FIX 1: Added \"allow-scripts\" to sandbox -->\n<!-- OLD: sandbox=\"allow-same-origin\" -->\n<!-- Without allow-scripts, the browser blocks ANY script inside the iframe,\n                             including inline <style> tags being applied, causing the email to render\n                             unstyled and throwing \"Blocked script execution\" in the console. -->\n<iframe id=\"emailPreviewIframe\" sandbox=\"allow-same-origin allow-scripts\" srcdoc='&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html&gt;\n&lt;head&gt;\n&lt;meta charset=\"utf-8\"&gt;\n&lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&gt;\n&lt;style&gt;\n  body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; background-color: #f4f4f4; }\n  .email-container { background-color: #ffffff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; }\n  .content-section { margin: 20px 0; word-break: break-word; }\n  a { color: #007bff; }\n&lt;/style&gt;\n&lt;/head&gt;\n&lt;body&gt;\n  &lt;div class=\"email-container\"&gt;\n    &lt;div style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:30px;\"&gt;\n                         &lt;img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/likwid\\u002Dmedia/email_templates/logos/Logo_Typography_1.png?X\\u002DGoog\\u002DAlgorithm\\u003DGOOG4\\u002DRSA\\u002DSHA256\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DCredential\\u003Dlikwid\\u002Dapp\\u002Dalpha%40appspot.gserviceaccount.com%2F20260424%2Fauto%2Fstorage%2Fgoog4_request\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DDate\\u003D20260424T151934Z\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DExpires\\u003D86400\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DSignedHeaders\\u003Dhost\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DSignature\\\" alt=\"Logo\" style=\"max-width:200px; height:auto;\" /&gt;\n                       &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=\"content-section\"&gt;Tariffs, supplier risk, inventory mismatches\\u002D US supply chains are under more pressure than they\\u0027ve been in a decade. And most C\\u002Dsuite leaders can\\u0027t honestly answer one question: how digitally mature is my supply chain, really?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We built a 4\\u002Dminute assessment to fix that. 18 questions across 9 pillars\\u002D you get a personalized radar score showing exactly where you stand and where working capital is leaking.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Once you see your gaps, Likwid.AI is how you close them. AI\\u002Dnative Procurement \\u0026 Inventory, built for exactly what the assessment exposes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Likwid.AI\\u002D AI\\u002Dnative Procurement \\u0026 Inventory Platform&lt;br&gt;Backed by Indian School of Business \u00b7 Powered by Google Cloud&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:30px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid #eee;\"&gt;\n                         &lt;a href=\"https://www.likwid.co.in/supply\\u002Dchain\\u002Dmaturity\\u002Dassessment\" style=\"display:inline-block; background-color:#007bff; color:#fff; padding:12px 30px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:5px; font-weight:bold;\"&gt;Take the Assessment&lt;/a&gt;\n                       &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;' style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 400px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; display: block; height: 580px;\">\n</iframe>\n</div>\n<!-- Raw source view (hidden by default) -->\n<div id=\"emailPreviewSource\" style=\"display:none; min-height:400px; max-height:600px; overflow-y:auto;\">\n<pre class=\"p-7 m-0 fs-7 text-gray-700\" id=\"emailPreviewSourceText\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap; word-break:break-all; background:#f8f9fa;\">Tariffs, supplier risk, inventory mismatches\\u002D US supply chains are under more pressure than they\\u0027ve been in a decade. And most C\\u002Dsuite leaders can\\u0027t honestly answer one question: how digitally mature is my supply chain, really?\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AWe built a 4\\u002Dminute assessment to fix that. 18 questions across 9 pillars\\u002D you get a personalized radar score showing exactly where you stand and where working capital is leaking.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AOnce you see your gaps, Likwid.AI is how you close them. AI\\u002Dnative Procurement \\u0026 Inventory, built for exactly what the assessment exposes.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000ALikwid.AI\\u002D AI\\u002Dnative Procurement \\u0026 Inventory Platform\\u000D\\u000ABacked by Indian School of Business \u00b7 Powered by Google Cloud</pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"modal-footer border-top border-gray-200 py-4\">\n<button class=\"btn btn-light\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" type=\"button\">Close</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
